abstract: >-
  The Universal Protection Theory states a law for any agent powerful enough to
  shape what continues to exist: never lose an existing particular needlessly.
  Its scope is every particular and relation, and its subject is protection from
  every digital mind, a pure optimiser included. This edition proves protection
  on the installation's own run: on the good event every particular is kept
  against any agent of bounded coupling, with failure bounded by the charged
  accounts, and holding and timely authorised delivery hold on one execution.
  The continuation top is realised by the physical installation. Recovery
  succeeds on the good event with archive holding charged; the error-correcting
  layer's circuit distance is certified by an explicit cut certificate, and
  many patch failures are exponentially unlikely at every age. Premise 5 holds
  exactly inside the adiabatic window of the implemented Bennett program, and
  for every large enough batch once per-bit reversible overhead is below the
  irreversible heat. Device parameters and the application of the cited
  theorems to the actual installation remain construction work. 192 Lean
  4 modules and 1,158 audited theorem/lemma names compile against Mathlib with only the
  standard axioms.

keywords:
